# DuckDB's release files that the build links and the bundles and images ship, by SHA-256.
# packaging/duckdb_lib.py refuses anything else. The version must be the one Cargo.lock's
# libduckdb-sys encodes (1.10505.0 is DuckDB 1.5.5): bumping the duckdb crate needs new lines here.
#
# Taken by downloading each file from https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb/releases/tag/v1.5.5 and
# hashing it, and cross-checked against the `digest` GitHub records for each release asset
# (`gh api repos/duckdb/duckdb/releases/tags/v1.5.5`); DuckDB publishes no checksum file of its own.
# The LICENSE is the one at the release's tag.
1fb8ce388157d84a25abe685a8a2520bf00c00321821968e4bb398fd766e7abb  v1.5.5/libduckdb-linux-amd64.zip
abe4f6f005ee0b448a058322f4263584b4bd1b6faf7ab4637b79eeaf978f8e9c  v1.5.5/libduckdb-linux-arm64.zip
7b5b8915cc382d0708636fe6385c0cdad5a61c9ff8ba2638b3e2141640783155  v1.5.5/libduckdb-osx-universal.zip
7e17fd31249fa875cb3b1c5e05c6c3e99b75509f6a2804ca176c217834de1dcb  v1.5.5/LICENSE
